Terminal:

User Settings:
sudo ./User\ Settings.sh

More information about the script can be found here: https://github.com/tammoOS/script
 
IP Netzwerk Scanner:
sudo netdiscover

custom OS Installation:
sudo apt-add-repository ppa:flexiondotorg/quickemu
sudo apt update
sudo apt install qemu-system-modules-spice
sudo apt install quickemu

get a Version with: quickget YOUR_VERSION

Versions and more informations can be found here: https://github.com/quickemu-project/quickemu/wiki/03-Create-macOS-virtual-machines

Settings:
nano YOUR_VERSION.conf
add RAM with: ram=5
change cpu cores with: cpu-cores=2

Run OS:
quickemu --vm YOUR_VERSION.conf


Windows exe installer:

How to install .exe file:
1. Download your .exe file with firefox
2. Open Filemanager and double click on the .exe file to install it
(Sometimes you must right click on the file and choose the first option)
3. Enjoy your the exe - programm :)
